WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:14.365
SuiFleet helps you organize devices and deliver software
updates. Your wallet is the approval tool for changes to your
account. A fleet is a workspace for devices managed together.
Open the console and choose Get started.

2
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:19.901
Click Connect and choose your wallet: Slush, an extension, or
Google where enabled.

3
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.547
This recording uses a scripted test wallet in place of Slush;
approve the connection.

4
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.565
Connected: the card shows your address and the network
(Testnet).

5
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.611
First time only: create your default fleet, then approve the
transaction.

6
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:42.328
Your fleet is selected. Next check device capacity: network
funds do not increase your device limit.
